For the inductive step, we first have to reconsider Properties P2 and P3 of Γ_C according to Lemma 4.1. Namely, consider an internal face f of Γ_C. All of its incident vertices are located on different layers according to Lemma 4.1. We define the layer-i-vertex v_i(f) with i ∈ {1, ..., 4} as follows.

\[
v_i(f) = \begin{cases}
t_i & \text{if } f \text{ is a triangle and } i \leq 3 \\
\emptyset & \text{if } f \text{ is a triangle and } i = 4 \\
q_i & \text{if } f \text{ is a quadrangle}
\end{cases}
\]
